\newlabel{fig:arch}{{1}{2}{\textbf {System architecture.} Three layers are new in this milestone: \textsc {(2)}~Character RAG injects persona knowledge, \textsc {(3)}~LLM + Emotion Arc Tracker turns scene + history into strict JSON emotion annotations, and \textsc {(5)}~an emotion-aware TTS dispatcher picks the right backend and reference clip. Layers \textsc {(1)}, \textsc {(4)} and Phase-1's Qwen3-TTS\,v5 were already in place.\relax }{figure.caption.1}{}}
