\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {(a)}\nobreakspace  {}Distribution of the 30 curated emotion-bucket references (5 per category) distilled from the 664 training clips; the flat distribution is intentional so the dispatcher always has a matching reference regardless of the LLM label. \textbf  {(b)}\nobreakspace  {}Phase-1 objective numbers: our Qwen3 SFT\nobreakspace  {}v5\nobreakspace  {}ep3 is tied with Qwen ZS on SIM\_gt (0.689 vs 0.710) but halves WER (4.25\% vs 12.0\%), and dominates Fish\nobreakspace  {}S2\nobreakspace  {}Pro on SIM\_gt at similar WER --- the remaining quality headroom is in \emph  {emotion}, not timbre.\relax }}{3}{figure.caption.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:phase1}{{3}{3}{\textbf {(a)}~Distribution of the 30 curated emotion-bucket references (5 per category) distilled from the 664 training clips; the flat distribution is intentional so the dispatcher always has a matching reference regardless of the LLM label. \textbf {(b)}~Phase-1 objective numbers: our Qwen3 SFT~v5~ep3 is tied with Qwen ZS on SIM\_gt (0.689 vs 0.710) but halves WER (4.25\% vs 12.0\%), and dominates Fish~S2~Pro on SIM\_gt at similar WER --- the remaining quality headroom is in \emph {emotion}, not timbre.\relax }{figure.caption.3}{}}
